          {
            "name": "reload_game",
            "description": "Reloads the running game environment. Prefer automatic Python/UI/Shader/Material hot reload when available; use this only when a full engine-side refresh is still needed.\n\nParameters:\n- reload_addons: When true, trigger the more complete addon-data + game reload path. Use it for resource changes such as JSON, PNG, audio, or other addon files not handled by automatic hot reload.",
